  {
   "rating": 2,
   "date": "2026-09-25T23:02:54-05:00",
   "body": "Good drop rate. I found all books easily without any separate kobold grinding required outside of finishing the three old slaying quests [i](10 vermin, 10 workers, 12 laborers)[/i].\r\n\r\nThis quest is part of a new chain that leads you outside of the starting area and involves objectives in the broader Elwynn Forest area. It's very much worth completing, as the final part rewards you with [b]green quality weapons[/b].",
   "replies": [
    "I don't understand how this can be described as a \"good\" drop rate. I have done this quest thrice now and at best I have had to kill double as many workers as I needed for the books",
    "Abysmal drop rate. I have killed around 20 Kobolds since picking the quest up and have exactly one book. EDIT: at 22 kills I got my second one. Edit 2: I stopped counting around 40, but I'd say I ended up at at least 60 kills for all the books (and I didn't pick the quest up until after I was done with the vermins)"
   ]
