  {
   "rating": 1,
   "date": "2026-10-19T20:56:16-05:00",
   "body": "Investigate Echo Ridge quest requires 10 kills. At the end of that quest I had 1 book. This is a 10% drop rate from the Workers.\nSkirmish at Echo Ridge quest requires 12 kills. At the end of that quest I had 7 books. This is a 50% drop rate from the Laborers during the quest.\nI killed five more Laborers for the last book. Giving 17 laborers yield 7 books, and an overall Laborer drop rate of 41% from the Laborers, total.\nThe over all total was 27 kills for 8 books, which is a total drop rate of 30% from both Workers and Laborers combined..",
